Z||000003||BAM-BAM||03-12-2000||03:01 PM||||  The TPS is new. I was getting an error code that indicated TPS, so I changedd it. And it is an automatic. May be this inherent to the auto. Other than that it runs great <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">. I'm in the process of changing the EGR tube and adding the Vacuum module that has been missing since I've owned it. Also, I have the opportunity to buy an 87GT 2.8 all power options, single owner, for $2000.00 seems like a great deal to me. But the wife wants me to wait.<BR>  BAM <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000004||GT Bastard||03-12-2000||03:40 PM||||Do you know what gears you're running?  I once drove and auto '85 GT before that had the std gear ratio and it was extremely lethargic even though it was in prime shape(or seemed to be.)  3.07's are std I believe.  Mine has 3.33's and takes off pretty nicely.  Let us know what you find.||||reg||1
